{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Only flesh with its life — its blood you shall not eat.</b> Rashi: He forbade them a limb from a living animal. Since every creeping thing was permitted to Noah, he was commanded the warning against a limb from a living animal; but the first man, to whom only the fruit of the ground was permitted, had no need to be commanded the warning against a limb from a living animal."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:35.206909994Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}